                <pb facs="0657" n="1391" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1391"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr.
                            Terrell.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-12-13"><hi rendition="#italic">December 13,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Referring to last paragraph your 685, admiral has been telegraphed to cooperate
                    heartily with you and enforce all writs issued by you to prevent any entry into
                    Turkey of naturalized citizens as armed revolutionists under provisions of
                    section cited.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Olney.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
